      "side": 1,
      "message": "The max and min checks need to be done against the value that will be written to the register.  Move this conversion before the max/min checks.\n\nFor example:\n\n    reg \u003d AC_CURRENT_TO_REG(ma);\n    if (reg \u003e AC_MAX)\n        reg \u003d ISL9241_AC_PROCHOT_CURRENT_MAX;\n    else if (reg \u003c AC_MIN)\n        reg \u003d ISL9241_AC_PROCHOT_CURRENT_MIN;\n    else\n        reg \u0026\u003d ISL9241_REG_AC_PROCHOT_MASK;",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 346,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 346,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "ad19deda7af779f9204c11dcf3def7902d7abe3a",
