        "id": 1329118
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-12-02T01:26:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In eldrid, BOARD_RS1\u003d10. So if we set AC_PROCHOT\u003d128mA, after convert it will become 64mA and block by reg \u0026\u003d ISL9241_REG_AC_PROCHOT_MASK. \n\nConvert first, will cause wrong value.\nSet AC_PROCHOT\u003d128mA, convert and become to 64mA. 64mA \u003c AC_MIN, it will set 128mA to charger.\nSet AC_PROCHOT\u003d6912mA(larger than AC_MAX), convert and become to 3456mA. It will not block by if (reg \u003e AC_MAX).",
      "parentUuid": "36c3276f_372d2f42",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 346,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 346,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "ad19deda7af779f9204c11dcf3def7902d7abe3a",
